  "limits": [
    "Fork resets child resource counters but initially duplicates wrapper memory; pre-exec footprint can enter child lifetime peak, and resource usage persists across exec. Parent ru_maxrss counters are not copied. Native VmHWM has current memory-image scope.",
    "Original12 raw model runs unchanged; fresh12 are a separate cohort with same binary/input/cases.",
    "Model uses original136byte NamedValue and40byte compact value; ordered metadata IDs preserve exact bytes including duplicates/NUL and schema changes. Exact full AIT1 is reconstructed, not a new file format.",
    "Retained phases include original input buffer and allocator residency; encoding adds another full output buffer. Peak and retained phase are different measures.",
    "Native and wait4 timings are model pipeline measurements only, with two repetitions and no interval; no whole-engine gains claimed.",
    "Real game RSS audit is a separate328-record corroboration. Sampled nativeVmHWM closely matches wait4 in those cohorts, unlike modelplateau. Sampling misses short transients and current wrapper snapshots do not reconstruct historical footprint. No retroactive corrections to game data."
  ]
